      "text": "Handy #PowerShell one-liner of the day:\n\nAlphabetize whatever is on the clipboard:\n\n~~~PowerShell\n@(@(Get-Clipboard) -split '(?>\\r\\n|\\n)' | Sort-Object) -join [Environment]::NewLine | Set-Clipboard\n~~~"
